# Play test of Thornwood (CIPlay thornwood, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe (from the land centre
# of the finished land): the camp on the south beach, the rope bridge over the gorge at x -20, the shrines, the temple
# on the hill at 15 25 (23.4 m).
island Thornwood
expect step 0
expect title The Boar King of Thornwood

# The explorer's camp: the diary and the map
walk -50 -78 to -45 -74 h=3
zone camp
expect step 1
read Explorer's diary
expect step 2
read Map of Thornwood

# The Shrine of the Roots, this side of the gorge
open Shrine of the Roots
expect story tusk 1

# Up to the rope bridge and across the gorge
walk -45 -70 to -40 -60 to -32 -50 to -25 -40 to -20 -33 h=14
walk -20 -33 to -20 -22 to -20 -12 h=13.2
expect stand -20.75 -22 h=13.6
zone bridge
expect step 3

# The Shrine of the Falls; the temple's chest stays shut with two tusks
open Shrine of the Falls
expect story tusk 2
open Temple offering
expect message won't open without three
expect story tusk 2

# The Shrine of the Hill
open Shrine of the Hill
expect story tusk 3
# (opening the temple's chest above took the player into the stone ring: that step is done already)
expect step 5

# Up the hill into the stone ring: the Warthog King and his guards
walk -20 -12 to -10 0 to 0 10 to 10 18 to 15 21 h=23.4
zone temple
expect message Warthog King
kill Warthog
expect step 6
expect animals Warthog 0
open Temple offering
expect story tusk 0
expect item Blueprint_Machete 1
expect done
